    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The traction part is fine, but I'm a bit worried about the patent. I've seen some talk about a potential legal challenge regarding the validity of our core data processing patent. If Nebula's legal team digs into this during due diligence, it's gonna tank the valuation. How should I handle that? Do I need to bring it up upfront, or is there a way to frame it so it doesn't scare them off?",
